        "summary": "The patient contacted the office by phone requesting a pain medication refill following a left rotator cuff surgery on 12/01/2025. He reported being out of medication, asked about using ibuprofen and Tylenol, and expressed a desire to wean off the pain medication. The diagnosis was status post left shoulder arthroscopy and acute left shoulder pain. Oxycodone-acetaminophen 5-325 mg was prescribed after a PDMP review, and he was advised to take Tylenol between doses and avoid ibuprofen due to a documented hive allergy. The patient denied current tobacco or alcohol use.",
