        "date": "09/28/2023",
        "provider": "Kareem R. Dolce, DPM; Helen Bogner, RN; Scott Elliott, CRNA; Angela Miller; Cortney Sparks, RN; Cassidy Story, RN BSN; Marc D. Dolce, DPM, FACFAS",
        "facility": "The Surgery Center of North Central Ohio",
        "bodyPart": "Ankle, Foot, Leg, Lower Leg",
        "medicineType": "Podiatry",
        "recordType": "Operative Report",
        "summary": "Preoperative Diagnosis: Other injury of muscle(s) and tendon(s) of peroneal muscle group at lower leg level, right leg, initial encounter. Postoperative Diagnosis: Other injury of muscle(s) and tendon(s) of peroneal muscle group at lower leg level, right leg, initial encounter. Procedure: Right repair of ruptured peroneal tendon with synovectomy was performed under general anesthesia on 09/28/2023 by Marc Dolce, DPM and Kareem R. Dolce, DPM. The surgical site was the right foot, marked and verified prior to the procedure, and the patient was positioned supine with safety measures in place. A tourniquet was applied to the right ankle at 300 mmHg from 10:03 to 10:29, and the wound was classified as clean (Class 1). The procedure included the use of cautery, and the surgical site was closed with staples and sutures, then dressed with 4x4's, ABD, Ace wrap, Adaptic, Betadine ointment, cast padding, Kerlix, and a splint. Intraoperative normothermia was maintained using warm blankets and a warming unit, and blood loss was minimal (5 mL). Cefazolin 3 grams IV was administered preoperatively for antibiotic prophylaxis, and sodium chloride 0.9% solution was used on the sterile field; clindamycin was ordered but not administered due to no known allergies. A specimen of right ankle synovitis was sent to Fisher Titus Medical Center for laboratory analysis. The patient\u2019s home medications included gabapentin, lisinopril, meloxicam, metoprolol succinate ER, and tizanidine, with no known drug or non-drug allergies.",
        "pdfLink": "pdf",
        "painScore": 7,
        "billingAmount": 34500.0,
        "severity": "moderate",
        "isPreCrash": false,
        "isStarred": false
