        "summary": "Pre-operative orders were placed to admit the patient for a surgical procedure, obtain vital signs on admission, insert a saline lock, and clip prep the surgical site, all approved and signed by Marc Dolce, DPM on 09/28/2023 at 10:34. Intraoperative medications included bupivacaine 0.5% injection, lidocaine HCl 2% injection, and sodium chloride 0.9% solution for the sterile field, as well as cefazolin (2g IV if \u2264120 kg, 3g IV if &gt;120 kg) or clindamycin (900mg IV in 50 ml saline if allergic to penicillin), all approved and signed by Marc Dolce, DPM on 09/28/2023. Post-operative orders included routine vital signs, diet as tolerated, IV fluids at KVO, ice and elevation to the operative extremity, neurovascular assessment, and weight bearing on the operative extremity with an operative shoe, with ice to the back of the right knee, and discharge when criteria were met, all approved and signed by Marc Dolce, DPM on 09/28/2023.",
