        "summary": "This claim form documented surgical procedures performed on 09/28/2023 for a condition related to employment with an injury date of 04/12/2023. Billed diagnoses included S86311A, M65871, and S9301XA, with procedures including CPT codes 27676, 27659, and 27680 on the right side.",
