        "bodyPart": "Ankle, Foot, Shoulder, Knee, Back, Lower Back",
        "medicineType": "Occupational Medicine",
        "recordType": "Independent Medical Examination",
        "summary": "In this addendum report, Dr. Glazer acknowledged that several conditions were not included in his prior report: ruptured right peroneal tendon, synovitis and tenosynovitis of the right ankle/foot, and subluxation of the right tarsal foot. He stated these additions did not change his previous opinions. Dr. Glazer opined with a reasonable degree of medical certainty that the patient had reached maximum medical improvement for all the following allowed conditions: right ankle sprain, left shoulder sprain, right knee sprain, low back strain, displaced dorsum of the right navicular foot, ruptured right peroneal tendon, synovitis and tenosynovitis of the right ankle/foot, and subluxation of the right tarsal foot.",
