        "summary": "This form, completed 04/12/2024, provides a history of the patient's conditions. It notes the patient first became unable to work due to the current condition on 04/12/2024. Diagnoses listed include a foot fracture/peroneal tendon rupture from September 2023 and a back strain/herniated disc. The patient reported being unable to sit or stand for prolonged periods and could not drive a semi. A spine MRI was performed on 08/03/2023. Previous physical therapy was noted for the knee in May 2013 and June 2023, and for the back in July and August 2023. The patient was not considered permanently disabled and had no permanent restrictions. The expected return to work date was listed as 02/06/2023, with a restriction to 4 hours per day, 20 hours per week.",
