        "summary": "Subjective: The patient presented for follow-up and reported experiencing good days and bad days with lumbar pain, and noted that he was working with a weight loss physician at Avita and planned to follow up with Dr. Seigel in May. Objective: No objective findings were documented on this page. Assessment: No formal assessment or diagnosis was documented on this page. Plan: No specific treatment plan or changes were documented on this page.",
