        "bodyPart": "Back, Lower Back",
        "medicineType": "Radiology",
        "recordType": "Imaging Report",
        "summary": "Body Part: Lower Back (L4-5 and L5-S1, MRI)\nImpression: MRI from 6/10/2025 was compared to 6/7/2023 and showed increased degenerative changes at L4-5 with Modic endplate changes, a slightly larger centrally located disc herniation causing bilateral neural foraminal narrowing, increased L5-S1 disc degeneration, and a left L5-S1 disc herniation causing increased left neuroforaminal narrowing. With progression of degenerative disc disease at L5-S1 and L4-5, slight increase in size of the disc herniations, and increased neuroforaminal narrowing at both levels, a 2 level TDA (L4-5 and L5-S1) was recommended.",
