        "summary": "A Request for Medical Service Reimbursement was filed for a diagnosis of L4/5 and L5/S1 lumbar disc herniation. The request was for daily dressing changes for post-operative wound care following surgery scheduled for 08/11/2025. The managed care organization (MCO) approved the request for services beginning 08/11/2025.",
