        "summary": "Subjective: The patient's work ability was evaluated following an injury where a semi pulled in front of his semi, causing a collision. He had not returned to work and was advised 'No work. F/U once cleared by surgeon'.\nObjective: The patient had ongoing wound care.\nAssessment: The patient was diagnosed with a displaced dorsum navicular fracture, disc herniation at L4-5 and L5-S1, sacroiliitis, right ankle and knee sprain, left shoulder sprain, and low back sprain. He was assigned temporary restrictions starting from 04/12/2023, with an estimated full-duty return-to-work date of 02/02/2026.\nPlan: The patient was to continue follow-up with the surgeon and wound care and was not released to work.",
